 "geometry": "prompt P = 4,895 tok; P+S = 6,791; two ~11k fillers evict APC (kv-cache-memory-bytes 2.6GB); retrieve forced by APC eviction; lmcache MP server per arm (fresh), chunk = align block (KV-DTYPE-DEPENDENT: fp8 KV -> align block 1600 -> max_num_batched_tokens must be in [1600,3199]; bf16/auto KV -> block 800 -> [800,1599]; GG validator requires block <= max_num_batched_tokens < 2*block and the lmcache server --chunk-size must equal the block; bf16 arms ran --max-num-batched-tokens 800, fp8 arms 2048). Comparator: 64-token greedy completion text + mean |chosen-logprob delta| vs the same-config cold generation.",
 "results": {
  "fp8_KV_cold_roundtrip": "CATASTROPHIC: store(cold, single writer, no APC interleaving) -> evict APC -> retrieve => U+FFFD/out-of-script garbage from token 1, mean |dlp| 3.52 vs C0 (the 2x's 4.36-4.50 class). Server log confirms Retrieved 4800.",
